and photos, redesign the site and add the extra pages. You only pay the difference between the two packages if you upgrade within 90 days of launch.</p></div></details><details><summary>Do I own the website?</summary><div><p>Yes. Once it's paid for, you own your domain, content and the site files on both packages. No lock-in.</p></div></details><details><summary>Can you redesign my existing site without losing my Google rankings?</summary><div><p>Yes. We map every existing URL, keep the pages that rank, and set up 301 redirects for anything that moves, so the authority your current site has built carries over.</p></div></details></div>
